{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702380/extras/65d6b0e6b08a562d9b111899fe2cb041.avif?t=1774368798\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702380/extras_big/65d6b0e6b08a562d9b111899fe2cb041.avif?t=1774368798 width=800 height=113 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The human world is but a replica of our reality, where history followed a familiar path until the early 2000s. But behind the veil of &quot;Dark Matter&quot; lies the Anomalous World\u00a0- God\u2019s failed prototype, built upon human memories and fictions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Human ambition shattered the barrier between us, and now, what was meant to stay hidden has become a daily threat. Some things need chaos and danger to grow and thrive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, you take on the role of Emilia Svitanko. She is an Essentiar - girl whose body has already begun to change, yet whose mind remains human. Driven by anomalous mobility and weapon proficiency, she work as a mercenary for the Daisen corporation to close &quot;Windows&quot; into the other world and hold back the Anomalies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702380/extras/562f51385b3bdc35bb4bfbe4dacbfafe.poster.avif?t=1774368798\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702380/extras/562f51385b3bdc35bb4bfbe4dacbfafe.webm?t=1774368798\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702380/extras/562f51385b3bdc35bb4bfbe4dacbfafe.mp4?t=1774368798\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702380/extras/faae5306af670af93e8623eea3a6e309.avif?t=1774368798\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702380/extras_big/faae5306af670af93e8623eea3a6e309.avif?t=1774368798 width=800 height=113 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No mags, no reloads. Zero hesitation. Daisen is a fast-paced shooter where killing is your only cure and weapons are always on the verge of overheating. The skills of mercenaries have evolved so far that it now resembles a dance of gun and needle rather than a suppression operation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your equipment wisely. Conventional ammo is gone, but keep an eye on your heat levels - his tech is a real hot-head! Cycle your weapons frequently and stay cool under pressure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast, thoughtful, stylish: There is no time to stand still; you must keep moving.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Healing? Only through murder: You\u2019re used to this by now, aren\u2019t you, Emilia? <br>The essence of anomalies flows within you...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702380/extras/5820d9f837f32bb92c1958becf23937c.poster.avif?t=1774368798\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702380/extras/5820d9f837f32bb92c1958becf23937c.webm?t=1774368798\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702380/extras/5820d9f837f32bb92c1958becf23937c.mp4?t=1774368798\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702380/extras/d181a704d8317b6ae8aadae7d417fc7b.avif?t=1774368798\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702380/extras_big/d181a704d8317b6ae8aadae7d417fc7b.avif?t=1774368798 width=800 height=113 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our community and chat with the developers on our <strong>Discord</strong> server. The community is waiting for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702380/extras/0303d95b0b00854a9419f668556c43d4.poster.avif?t=1774368798\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702380/extras/0303d95b0b00854a9419f668556c43d4.webm?t=1774368798\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702380/extras/0303d95b0b00854a9419f668556c43d4.mp4?t=1774368798\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3702380?t=1774368798","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702380/e2d850acdbdbdc5c3d1461cec01fdbf74c8f7ce0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774368798","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702380/ab8e2e1865a822385cd682b2a4e52724ad3bd126/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774368798","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702380/ab8e2e1865a822385cd682b2a4e52724ad3bd126/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774368798","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Commentary available","id":14},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains stylized first-person gun and melee combat, with visible blood splashes during combat."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702380/extras/65d6b0e6b08a562d9b111899fe2cb041.avif?t=1774368798\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702380/extras_big/65d6b0e6b08a562d9b111899fe2cb041.avif?t=1774368798 width=800 height=113 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The human world is but a replica of our reality, where history followed a familiar path until the early 2000s. But behind the veil of &quot;Dark Matter&quot; lies the Anomalous World\u00a0- God\u2019s failed prototype, built upon human memories and fictions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Human ambition shattered the barrier between us, and now, what was meant to stay hidden has become a daily threat. Some things need chaos and danger to grow and thrive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, you take on the role of Emilia Svitanko. She is an Essentiar - girl whose body has already begun to change, yet whose mind remains human. Driven by anomalous mobility and weapon proficiency, she work as a mercenary for the Daisen corporation to close &quot;Windows&quot; into the other world and hold back the Anomalies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702380/extras/562f51385b3bdc35bb4bfbe4dacbfafe.poster.avif?t=1774368798\" width=80